[32m+[m[32mStart sign-in by navigating the browser to[m
[32m+[m[32m`http://localhost:8080/oauth2/authorization/google`. After Google verifies the[m
[32m+[m[32muser, Spring creates a server-side session and redirects to `AUTH_SUCCESS_URL`.[m
