[32m+[m[32muser, and call `POST /api/auth/logout` with the CSRF header/token obtained from[m
[32m+[m[32m`GET /api/auth/csrf`. The session is the authentication credential; do not put[m
[32m+[m[32mOAuth access tokens in browser storage.[m
